{"version":1,"key":"card:319","content":{"id":319,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何比较两个值是否相同，最简单的办法直接通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"===","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行判断"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const isSame = (x, y) => {\n  return x === y;\n}","language":"js","uuid":"a3d31d43-6bbf-4471-832b-4eb8f2e2ea2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是存在两种特殊情况："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"+0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不同，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"+0 === -0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"NaN"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"NaN","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相同，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"NaN === NaN","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"false","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"针对第一种情况，考虑到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1 / +0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的结果是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Infinity","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1 / -0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的结果是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-Infinity","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此进行如下改善："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const isSame = (x, y) => {\n  if (x === y) {\n    return x !== 0 || (1 / x === 1 / y);\n  }\n  return false;\n}","language":"js","uuid":"60e3a31d-82d4-42c1-9d2f-18139d734a12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"针对第二种情况，NaN 与任何值都不相同，与自身都不相等，利用这个特性进行如下改善："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const isSame = (x, y) => {\n  if (x === y) {\n    return x !== 0 || (1 / x === 1 / y);\n  }\n  return x !== x && y !== y;\n}","language":"js","uuid":"f8e24ee9-589f-402c-861b-a1e49d49bbb5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑判断一个相等都这么麻烦，TC39 出手了，给出了 "},{"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.is","code":true}],"refId":271,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":262},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，直接解决上面的问题"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const isSame = (x, y) => {\n  return Object.is(x, y);\n}","language":"js","uuid":"78e37819-6859-4d1f-bd0b-1399281934a3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bz4y157JL","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"写框架和写业务有什么不同"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1695991568729,"updateTime":1743303640425,"linkedCards":[{"id":242,"target":{"key":"card:242","type":"card","id":242},"summary":"Set 集合是一个有序的、没有重复元素的集合。通过 new Set() 得到一个 Set 对象， Set 集合提供如下 API add(item) ：向集合中添加元素 item has(item) ：判断集合中是否有 item 元素 del...","tags":["JavaScript/Set"]},{"id":271,"target":{"key":"card:271","type":"card","id":271},"summary":"在比较两个值时，一般会使用 == 或者更加严格的 === ，更多的人乐意使用 === ，但是即使是 === 也会不准确，例如 console.log(+0 === -0); // true console.log(NaN === NaN);...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640425},"links":{"card:271":{"key":"card:271","type":"card","id":271}}}